            {
                "entry_id": "d3094d21-3f52-3516-9b75-b83cb2796274",
                "word": "smart",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ffc1a19-2079-361a-87f8-e5869e426a7c",
                        "entry_id": "d3094d21-3f52-3516-9b75-b83cb2796274",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Intelligent, fin, habile."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0333ef96-f6d8-4962-92df-a06a2e86f134",
                                "sense_id": "2ffc1a19-2079-361a-87f8-e5869e426a7c",
                                "text": "Vous n’êtes pas de ces congrégations-là, vous; vous n’avez jamais volé vos amis; aussi vous avez été pauvre comme moi et, comme moi aussi, le serez probablement toujours. Eh! bien c’est votre faute, comme la mienne, fallait être plus... smart!! Il est trop tard maintenant et nous resterons pauvres, mais honnêtes, tous les deux."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "df2a3ba9-e7d4-34f1-bf6e-2446c0bfff23",
                        "entry_id": "d3094d21-3f52-3516-9b75-b83cb2796274",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Élégant, raffiné, chic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Anglicism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0c7d87b6-9f2b-4cf2-a8d5-0df17e73bcda",
                                "sense_id": "df2a3ba9-e7d4-34f1-bf6e-2446c0bfff23",
                                "text": "Un costume smart."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c00c576d-63ac-4bf9-8260-3144482cee7c",
                                "sense_id": "df2a3ba9-e7d4-34f1-bf6e-2446c0bfff23",
                                "text": "Ces nanas, elles sont trop smart !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c4288aa-b7a8-4ccf-9a96-197782e64ac9",
                                "sense_id": "df2a3ba9-e7d4-34f1-bf6e-2446c0bfff23",
                                "text": "Il paraît qu’un nouveau mot vient de s’acclimater dans la langue du high-life. On disait chic, v’lan, dans le train. On a dit galbeux, catapulteux. On affectionnait select. Maintenant, à ce que l’on assure, la grande mode est de dire smart. On dit : « Cette soirée était tout à fait smart. Très smart, la duchesse ! Smartissime le jeune baron ». Jusqu’au jour où, les épiciers s’étant emparés du vocable, il ne sera plus smart du tout de dire smart."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7545bee7-4679-4132-b386-3cf23cdeb633",
                                "sense_id": "df2a3ba9-e7d4-34f1-bf6e-2446c0bfff23",
                                "text": "En disant aux Verdurin que Swann était très « smart », Odette leur avait fait craindre un « ennuyeux ». Il leur fit au contraire une excellente impression dont à leur insu sa fréquentation dans la société élégante était une des causes indirectes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5eeb8c34-859c-4c31-bd67-ab74917d7a63",
                                "sense_id": "df2a3ba9-e7d4-34f1-bf6e-2446c0bfff23",
                                "text": "Omniprésentes durant l’Euro, mobilisées sur tous les fronts par le gouvernement et les mairies, les sociétés de vigiles - rebaptisées \"entreprises privées de sécurité\", c'est plus smart - recrutent à tour de bras."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "682550ce-67f5-42d8-bfd7-2aa83c8b9418",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3094d21-3f52-3516-9b75-b83cb2796274",
                        "target_lang_word": "smart",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "smart",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b40c090-86be-3432-8d59-d9b4c73bb24e",
                                        "entry_id": "f5f4282e-951d-3768-b9e8-dc78bf3bdca2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To hurt or sting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bcb772bb-6ce4-4e0a-9cb8-e970e1c88539",
                                                "sense_id": "6b40c090-86be-3432-8d59-d9b4c73bb24e",
                                                "text": "After being hit with a pitch, the batter exclaimed \"Ouch, my arm smarts!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83b0eee5-1f44-4977-b5d9-7e72eca85bf0",
                                                "sense_id": "6b40c090-86be-3432-8d59-d9b4c73bb24e",
                                                "text": "He moved convulsively, and as he did so, said, \"I'll be quiet, Doctor. Tell them to take off the strait waistcoat. I have had a terrible dream, and it has left me so weak that I cannot move. What's wrong with my face? It feels all swollen, and it smarts dreadfully.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0da1e860-f1cc-4193-b2f0-9913e56c325a",
                                                "sense_id": "6b40c090-86be-3432-8d59-d9b4c73bb24e",
                                                "text": "When the thrashing stopped, Fina used the pipe to roll the first woman's corpse over. She bent down, feeling a curious distance between the sudden serenity in her mind and the actions of her limbs, and beat the flames off the jacket with her bare hands. They were sooty and smarting as she used them to pry the garment off the woman's slack shoulders, and threw it over her own."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab5ecb04-69ce-3a63-9436-92e7d9468e94",
                                        "entry_id": "f5f4282e-951d-3768-b9e8-dc78bf3bdca2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause a smart or sting in."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18d54fd6-a04c-47b6-b064-3bb90df4a125",
                                                "sense_id": "ab5ecb04-69ce-3a63-9436-92e7d9468e94",
                                                "text": "A goad that […] smarts the flesh."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab18b692-7e8a-3c2a-a62e-8914ac257619",
                                        "entry_id": "f5f4282e-951d-3768-b9e8-dc78bf3bdca2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To feel a pungent pain of mind; to feel sharp pain or grief; to be punished severely; to feel the sting of evil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ecb56ed-ad32-4799-bf1f-9ae338c4f6b1",
                                                "sense_id": "ab18b692-7e8a-3c2a-a62e-8914ac257619",
                                                "text": "You think this cruel? take it for a rule, / No creature ſmarts ſo little as a Fool."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "393b9e5b-496b-48ba-8f76-55f5d7ba35aa",
                                                "sense_id": "ab18b692-7e8a-3c2a-a62e-8914ac257619",
                                                "text": "He that is ſurety for a ſtranger ſhall ſmart for it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a97e4abe-302c-4b33-8d27-cce9c678650c",
                                                "sense_id": "ab18b692-7e8a-3c2a-a62e-8914ac257619",
                                                "text": "Meanvvhile the Abate exulted in ſucceſsful vengeance, and the marquis ſmarted beneath the ſtings of diſappointment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "429e1042-e864-4d8f-916d-153c81ddaa07",
                                                "sense_id": "ab18b692-7e8a-3c2a-a62e-8914ac257619",
                                                "text": "Tiresias. I say that you are living with your next of kin in unimagined shame.\nOedipus. Do you think you can say such things and never smart for it?\nTiresias. Yes, if there be strength in truth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "smart",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "525a011f-dd14-3593-9a82-02fe9b70f6de",
                                        "entry_id": "98b45cf8-c716-30ea-8858-9106de5e2297",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhibiting social ability or cleverness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1532d1cd-3dd6-4e0b-8de4-dfd161291075",
                                                "sense_id": "525a011f-dd14-3593-9a82-02fe9b70f6de",
                                                "text": "I always preferred the church, and I still do. But that was not smart enough for my family. They recommended the army. That was a great deal too smart for me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d0dc344-2960-3734-b49b-1137babca831",
