                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhibiting intellectual knowledge, such as that found in books."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f43f8ef0-38e2-31c7-8c48-01821ef77d79",
                                        "entry_id": "98b45cf8-c716-30ea-8858-9106de5e2297",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Equipped with intelligent behaviour (digital/computer technology)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-compounds",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5709c5a-0f5a-4d0e-b548-cf035e702610",
                                                "sense_id": "f43f8ef0-38e2-31c7-8c48-01821ef77d79",
                                                "text": "smart car"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "019a434b-11e5-49a8-b0f4-3cee19900135",
                                                "sense_id": "f43f8ef0-38e2-31c7-8c48-01821ef77d79",
                                                "text": "smartcard"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca42b072-2529-4e11-894f-2fdb8579f2b9",
                                                "sense_id": "f43f8ef0-38e2-31c7-8c48-01821ef77d79",
                                                "text": "smartphone"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6803c66d-db84-429c-955a-53d86e603851",
                                                "sense_id": "f43f8ef0-38e2-31c7-8c48-01821ef77d79",
                                                "text": "“Imagine this,” says an advertising consultant named Barry Lowenthal. “I’m a smart toaster, and I’m collecting data on how many times the toaster is used.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdf8bbdc-f519-303a-95e2-91905becc7a8",
                                        "entry_id": "98b45cf8-c716-30ea-8858-9106de5e2297",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Good-looking; well dressed; fine; fashionable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5853e49b-670f-43b5-89f0-2650c8d2e230",
                                                "sense_id": "cdf8bbdc-f519-303a-95e2-91905becc7a8",
                                                "text": "a smart outfit"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d809d467-804c-403e-9d79-28aa38f94a64",
                                                "sense_id": "cdf8bbdc-f519-303a-95e2-91905becc7a8",
                                                "text": "You look smart in that business suit."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be077e05-2fa8-340f-9622-221faac0fd85",
                                        "entry_id": "98b45cf8-c716-30ea-8858-9106de5e2297",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cleverly shrewd and humorous in a way that may be rude and disrespectful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80debe6f-680a-47a7-a92d-44d860e00c97",
                                                "sense_id": "be077e05-2fa8-340f-9622-221faac0fd85",
                                                "text": "He became tired of his girlfriend's smart remarks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8a8eb72-7342-4508-8019-23493b9a4da6",
                                                "sense_id": "be077e05-2fa8-340f-9622-221faac0fd85",
                                                "text": "Don't get smart with me!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "522f4125-ae9d-436c-88ae-2880454e6b9c",
                                                "sense_id": "be077e05-2fa8-340f-9622-221faac0fd85",
                                                "text": "Who, for the poor renown of being smart / Would leave a sting within a brother's heart?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eafca835-3070-4969-ab08-5326e5fb5df1",
                                                "sense_id": "be077e05-2fa8-340f-9622-221faac0fd85",
                                                "text": "I played a sentence or two at my butt, which I thought very smart, when my ill genius, who I verily believed inspired him purely for my destruction, suggested to him such a reply"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61096a56-4fe7-337e-9146-9e6ecdd3f77d",
                                        "entry_id": "98b45cf8-c716-30ea-8858-9106de5e2297",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sudden and intense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed1ec6fc-cc62-4586-a3a5-a06c0cd3ab9a",
                                                "sense_id": "61096a56-4fe7-337e-9146-9e6ecdd3f77d",
                                                "text": "smart skirmishes, in which many fell"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd205b2f-48f0-41c7-ae4a-ecd7e04af47b",
                                                "sense_id": "61096a56-4fe7-337e-9146-9e6ecdd3f77d",
                                                "text": "There is a smart shower at 5 P.M., and in the midst of it a hummingbird is busy about the flowers in the garden, unmindful of it, though you would think that each big drop that struck him would be a serious accident."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73fbbca7-e805-325b-9c6b-853a22928d21",
                                        "entry_id": "98b45cf8-c716-30ea-8858-9106de5e2297",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing sharp pain; stinging."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ed86605-a2de-4f44-be89-1381b545a9db",
                                                "sense_id": "73fbbca7-e805-325b-9c6b-853a22928d21",
                                                "text": "How smart a lash that speech doth give my conscience."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "598b3533-9f94-3669-953f-d81715f46741",
                                        "entry_id": "98b45cf8-c716-30ea-8858-9106de5e2297",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sharp; keen; poignant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
