                            {
                                "target_word": "smart",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5129abbb-5547-3b9e-9b99-0cb9cf6e3467",
                                        "entry_id": "b03d6f90-775f-3b2b-b8cc-2753cc99e7e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sharp, quick, lively pain; a sting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47aeaccd-3a81-49c2-9ced-15a0eae6fbe9",
                                                "sense_id": "5129abbb-5547-3b9e-9b99-0cb9cf6e3467",
                                                "text": "[…] the bodie had no smart / Of any wound: it was the minde that felt the cruell stings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35cee94a-f3c7-4259-9435-7162fbf4878b",
                                                "sense_id": "5129abbb-5547-3b9e-9b99-0cb9cf6e3467",
                                                "text": "If chance some Shepherd with a distant Dart / The Savage wound, he rowzes at the Smart, / He foams, he roars […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff929302-5569-4364-a5fb-a631093c62fe",
                                                "sense_id": "5129abbb-5547-3b9e-9b99-0cb9cf6e3467",
                                                "text": "Of course Tommy came to grief, tumbled upon a hornets’ nest and got stung; but being used to woe, he bore the smart manfully […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd1f1c2b-d24f-417f-bfa5-e7d523acf26c",
                                                "sense_id": "5129abbb-5547-3b9e-9b99-0cb9cf6e3467",
                                                "text": "The smart of his wounded hand woke Scobie at two in the morning."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd743ee9-71f0-3562-ace5-4d56083c4891",
                                        "entry_id": "b03d6f90-775f-3b2b-b8cc-2753cc99e7e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mental pain or suffering; grief; affliction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bf1231e-0c6f-4a86-ac79-1ca40c17aa59",
                                                "sense_id": "bd743ee9-71f0-3562-ace5-4d56083c4891",
                                                "text": "Mishaps are maistred by aduice discrete, / And counsell mitigates the greatest smart; / Found neuer help, who neuer would his hurts impart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95ddcc72-fe25-47b6-82f9-e1b8ae8e688d",
                                                "sense_id": "bd743ee9-71f0-3562-ace5-4d56083c4891",
                                                "text": "But oh why didst thou not stay here below / To bless us with thy heav’n lov’d innocence, […] / To stand ’twixt us and our deserved smart / But thou canst best perform that office where thou art."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1a90f17-1be2-4f57-b1d0-8504a9aba7bd",
                                                "sense_id": "bd743ee9-71f0-3562-ace5-4d56083c4891",
                                                "text": "I was so humiliated, hurt, spurned, offended, angry, sorry,—I cannot hit upon the right name for the smart—God knows what its name was,—that tears started to my eyes."
                                            },
                                            {
